    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 20250530</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_20250530/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 15:26:33 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_20250530/</guid>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#xA;&#xA;import &amp;#34;sync&amp;#34;&#xA;&#xA;func main() {&#xA;&#x9;var wg sync.WaitGroup&#xA;&#x9;foo := make(chan int)&#xA;&#x9;bar := make(chan int)&#xA;&#x9;wg.Add(1)&#xA;&#x9;go func() {&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;defer wg.Done()&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;select {&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;case foo &amp;lt;- &amp;lt;-bar:&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;default:&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;println(&amp;#34;default&amp;#34;)&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;}&#xA;&#x9;}()&#xA;&#x9;wg.Wait()&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2 class=&#34;heading-element&#34; id=&#34;correct-answer-deadlock-no-output-program-hangs&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Correct Answer: &lt;strong&gt;Deadlock (no output, program hangs)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#correct-answer-deadlock-no-output-program-hangs&#34; class=&#34;heading-mark&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg class=&#34;octicon octicon-link&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 16 16&#34; version=&#34;1.1&#34; width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class=&#34;heading-element&#34; id=&#34;analysis&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Analysis:&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#analysis&#34; class=&#34;heading-mark&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg class=&#34;octicon octicon-link&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 16 16&#34; version=&#34;1.1&#34; width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;This code will &lt;strong&gt;deadlock&lt;/strong&gt;; it will not output &amp;ldquo;default&amp;rdquo; nor panic. Instead, the program will hang and cannot continue execution. The reasons are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 095</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_095/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 20:45:23 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_095/</guid>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Output of the following code:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#xA;&#xA;import &amp;#34;sync&amp;#34;&#xA;&#xA;func main() {&#xA;    var wg sync.WaitGroup&#xA;    foo := make(chan int)&#xA;    bar := make(chan int)&#xA;    wg.Add(1)&#xA;    go func() {&#xA;        defer wg.Done()&#xA;        select {&#xA;        case foo &amp;lt;- &amp;lt;-bar:&#xA;        default:&#xA;            println(&amp;#34;default&amp;#34;)&#xA;        }&#xA;    }()&#xA;    wg.Wait()&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;A: default&#xA;B: panic&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Conventionally, one might expect the &lt;code&gt;default&lt;/code&gt; branch of the &lt;code&gt;select&lt;/code&gt; statement in &lt;code&gt;go func&lt;/code&gt; to execute, and the program to run normally. However, the result is not that, but a deadlock. You can test this via: &lt;a href=&#34;https://play.studygolang.com/p/kF4pOjYXbXf.&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://play.studygolang.com/p/kF4pOjYXbXf.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
